{
  "declaredLength": 4516,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "깜짝 토크!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE5CC9DD0020D1A0D06C002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "볼 잭에 당한\n몬스터볼을 발견했어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCFC0020C7ADC5D00020B2F9D55C000ABAACC2A4D130BCFCC7440020BC1CACACD588C5B4002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "볼 잭이요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCFC0020C7ADC774C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그게 뭐예요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC8C0020BB50C608C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "플레어단에서 연구하던 것 중 하나야.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n몬스터볼에 컴퓨터 바이러스를 심어서\n볼을 사용할 수 없게 하려 했지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D50CB808C5B4B2E8C5D0C11C0020C5F0AD6CD558B3580020AC830020C9110020D558B098C57C002E00100001BE01000ABAACC2A4D130BCFCC5D00020CEF4D4E8D1300020BC14C774B7ECC2A4B97C0020C2ECC5B4C11C000ABCFCC7440020C0ACC6A9D5600020C2180020C5C6AC8C0020D558B8240020D588C9C0002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "듣기만 해도 소름 끼치지 않아?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n만약 완성됐더라면\n칼로스지방이 어떻게 됐을지...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4E3AE30B9CC0020D574B3C40020C18CB9840020B07CCE58C9C00020C54AC544003F00100001BE01000AB9CCC57D0020C644C131B410B354B77CBA74000ACE7CB85CC2A4C9C0BC29C7740020C5B4B5BBAC8C0020B410C744C9C0002E002E002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 이제부터가 본론이야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020C774C81CBD80D130AC000020BCF8B860C774C57C002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "볼 잭에 당한 그 볼 안에는\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>볼케니온<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>이라는 포켓몬이 들어 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCFC0020C7ADC5D00020B2F9D55C0020ADF80020BCFC0020C548C5D0B294000A00100002FF000006BCFCCF00B2C8C62800100002FF000000C774B77CB2940020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020B4E4C5B40020C788C5B4002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어째서 환상의 포켓몬이라 불리는\n볼케니온이 볼 안에 있는지는 의문이지만.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C9F8C11C0020D658C0C1C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC774B77C0020BD88B9ACB294000ABCFCCF00B2C8C628C7740020BCFC0020C548C5D00020C788B294C9C0B2940020C758BB38C774C9C0B9CC002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼 나는 볼 안에 갇혀 버린\n포켓몬을 꺼내 주고 싶어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34D2BC0020B098B2940020BCFC0020C548C5D00020AC07D6000020BC84B9B0000AD3ECCF13BAACC7440020AEBCB0B40020C8FCACE00020C2F6C5B4002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지금부터 네가 맡을 일을 설명해 줄게!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n볼케니온을 볼에서 꺼내고 나면\n네가 다시 잡는 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0AE08BD80D1300020B124AC000020B9E1C7440020C77CC7440020C124BA85D5740020C904AC8C002100100001BE01000ABCFCCF00B2C8C628C7440020BCFCC5D0C11C0020AEBCB0B4ACE00020B098BA74000AB124AC000020B2E4C2DC0020C7A1B2940020AC70C57C002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "볼케니온을 잡을 준비가 되었다면\n내게 말을 걸어 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCFCCF00B2C8C628C7440020C7A1C7440020C900BE44AC000020B418C5C8B2E4BA74000AB0B4AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C918002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "볼케니온을 잡을 각오는 됐어?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCFCCF00B2C8C628C7440020C7A1C7440020AC01C624B2940020B410C5B4003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "됐어요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B410C5B4C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "볼케니온이 기다리고 있다구!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCFCCF00B2C8C628C7740020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788B2E4AD6C002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아 좋아!\n그럼, 시작해 볼까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC5440020C88BC5440021000AADF8B7FC002C0020C2DCC791D5740020BCFCAE4C002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "근데, 한 가지 문제가 있단 말이지...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n볼케니온을 꺼내 주기 위해\n컴퓨터 바이러스를 제거하고<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n볼을 고장 내지 않고 열 수 있는\n장치를 만들긴 했는데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "만들긴 했는데...?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9CCB4E4AE340020D588B294B370002E002E002E003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭔가 불안한데요...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB54AC000020BD88C548D55CB370C694002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "상대가 어마어마한 힘을 소유한\n볼케니온인 만큼,<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n볼에서 나오자마자 날뛸 확률이\n100%라는 거야!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C1B300AC000020C5B4B9C8C5B4B9C8D55C0020D798C7440020C18CC720D55C000ABCFCCF00B2C8C628C7780020B9CCD07C002C00100001BE01000ABCFCC5D0C11C0020B098C624C790B9C8C7900020B0A0B6F80020D655B960C774000A0031003000300025B77CB2940020AC70C57C0021002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지만 안심해도 돼!\n볼케니온의 스페셜리스트를 불렀으니까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0B9CC0020C548C2ECD574B3C40020B3FC0021000ABCFCCF00B2C8C628C7580020C2A4D398C15CB9ACC2A4D2B8B97C0020BD88B800C73CB2C8AE4C002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스페셜리스트?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4D398C15CB9ACC2A4D2B8003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런 사람이 있어요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F00020C0ACB78CC7740020C788C5B4C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바로 나야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14B85C0020B098C57C002100100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르시티의 길이란 길은 전부 달려 본 만큼,\n미르 출판에서 최단 거리로 달려왔지!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C2DCD2F0C7580020AE38C774B7800020AE38C7400020C804BD800020B2ECB8240020BCF80020B9CCD07C002C000ABBF8B9740020CD9CD310C5D0C11C0020CD5CB2E80020AC70B9ACB85C0020B2ECB824C654C9C0002100100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이본 씨는 미르 출판의 부편집장이라\n볼케니온 극비 메모를 가지고 있거든.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BCF80020C528B2940020BBF8B9740020CD9CD310C7580020BD80D3B8C9D1C7A5C774B77C000ABCFCCF00B2C8C6280020ADF9BE440020BA54BAA8B97C0020AC00C9C0ACE00020C788AC70B4E0002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "극비 메모의 내용 중\n‘힘의 비밀’ 부분에는 이런 내용이 있어.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“산도 날려버릴 만한 위력의\n 수증기 폭발을 일으키기 위해서는<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n 수분을 한순간에\n 기체로 만들 정도의<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n 초고열 기관이 체내에\n 필요하다는 추론을 세운다.”<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 136
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그리고 ‘나라를 세운’ 부분에는\n이런 내용이 있지.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n“칼로스지방 남서부에서는\n 볼케니온을 나라를 세운<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n 포켓몬으로 숭상하는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n 풍습이 있는 것 같다.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n 사람들은 볼케니온이 일으킨\n 수증기 폭발에 의해<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n 자신들이 사는 평야가\n 생겼다고 생각하는 듯하다.”<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 160
    },
    {
      "displayText": "엄청 강할 것 같은데!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5C4CCAD0020AC15D5600020AC830020AC19C740B370002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "칼로스 남부에서는\n과거 원인 불명의 대폭발에 의해<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n거대한 산맥이 소멸한 적도 있거든.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE7CB85CC2A40020B0A8BD80C5D0C11CB294000AACFCAC700020C6D0C7780020BD88BA85C7580020B300D3EDBC1CC5D00020C758D57400100001BE00000AAC70B300D55C0020C0B0B9E5C7740020C18CBA78D55C0020C801B3C40020C788AC70B4E0002E00100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떻게 봐도\n볼케니온과 관련된 일 같네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5BBAC8C0020BD10B3C4000ABCFCCF00B2C8C628ACFC0020AD00B828B41C0020C77C0020AC19B124002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "볼에서 꺼내도 될지 조금 고민되긴 하지만,\n꺼내 주고 싶다는 마음에는 변함없어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCFCC5D0C11C0020AEBCB0B4B3C40020B420C9C00020C870AE080020ACE0BBFCB418AE340020D558C9C0B9CC002C000AAEBCB0B40020C8FCACE00020C2F6B2E4B2940020B9C8C74CC5D0B2940020BCC0D568C5C6C5B4002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이제 연구소 지하로 가 보자!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C81C0020C5F0AD6CC18C0020C9C0D558B85C0020AC000020BCF4C790002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, 내 말 들리지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C0020B0B40020B9D00020B4E4B9ACC9C0003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나와 이본은 방 밖에서\n너의 분투를 응원하고 있을게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 3176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098C6400020C774BCF8C7400020BC290020BC16C5D0C11C000AB108C7580020BD84D22CB97C0020C751C6D0D558ACE00020C788C744AC8C002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "같은 공간 안에 있으면 위험하잖아.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 3244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC19C7400020ACF5AC040020C548C5D00020C788C73CBA740020C704D5D8D558C796C544002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 아까 건네줬던\n볼케니온의 볼을 던져 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 3292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020C544AE4C0020AC74B124C92CB358000ABCFCCF00B2C8C628C7580020BCFCC7440020B358C8380020C918002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "볼케니온... 역시 날뛰려는 모양이야!\n그럼, 힘내서 잡아 봐!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 3356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCFCCF00B2C8C628002E002E002E0020C5EDC2DC0020B0A0B6F0B824B2940020BAA8C591C774C57C0021000AADF8B7FC002C0020D798B0B4C11C0020C7A1C5440020BD10002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부오오~오!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 3436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80C624C624007EC624002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 3452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잡으라고 한 거 잊었어!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A1C73CB77CACE00020D55C0020AC700020C78AC5C8C5B40021003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "짜잔~!\n용사가 훌륭하게 볼케니온을 포획했구나!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9DCC794007E0021000AC6A9C0ACAC000020D6CCB96DD558AC8C0020BCFCCF00B2C8C628C7440020D3ECD68DD588AD6CB098002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떤 포켓몬이든 포획하고 나면\n얌전해진다니, 신기하지 않아?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A40020D3ECCF13BAACC774B4E00020D3ECD68DD558ACE00020B098BA74000AC58CC804D574C9C4B2E4B2C8002C0020C2E0AE30D558C9C00020C54AC544003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿/",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "환상의 포켓몬과 싸우는 모습을 보니\n온몸에서 전율이 흘렀어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D658C0C1C7580020D3ECCF13BAACACFC0020C2F8C6B0B2940020BAA8C2B5C7440020BCF4B2C8000AC628BAB8C5D0C11C0020C804C728C7740020D758B800C5B4002100100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁 하나 해도 될까?\n볼케니온에게 미르 여기저기를<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n날려 버리게 해서 마라톤을...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C10020D558B0980020D574B3C40020B420AE4C003F000ABCFCCF00B2C8C628C5D0AC8C0020BBF8B9740020C5ECAE30C800AE30B97C00100001BE00000AB0A0B8240020BC84B9ACAC8C0020D574C11C0020B9C8B77CD1A4C744002E002E002E00100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "꿈도 야무지셔!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AFC8B3C40020C57CBB34C9C0C154002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당연히 농담이지!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n아무튼, 덕분에 편집장님이 깜짝 놀랄 만한\n기사를 쓸 수 있을 것 같아!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C5F0D7880020B18DB2F4C774C9C0002100100001BE01000AC544BB34D2BC002C0020B355BD84C5D00020D3B8C9D1C7A5B2D8C7740020AE5CC9DD0020B180B7840020B9CCD55C000AAE30C0ACB97C0020C4F80020C2180020C788C7440020AC830020AC19C544002100100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 미르 출판까지\n달려서 돌아가야겠다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020BBF8B9740020CD9CD310AE4CC9C0000AB2ECB824C11C0020B3CCC544AC00C57CACA0B2E4002100100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "플레어단이 저지른 일 때문에\n자유를 빼앗긴 존재가 그 밖에도 더 있겠지...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n나도 소장 대리라는 이름의\n새장 속에 갇힌 신세지만...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 4052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐, 볼케니온은 새 파트너를 얻은 덕분에\n더 이상 그렇지 않게 됐지만 말이야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 4216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50002C0020BCFCCF00B2C8C628C7400020C0C80020D30CD2B8B108B97C0020C5BBC7400020B355BD84C5D0000AB3540020C774C0C10020ADF8B807C9C00020C54AAC8C0020B410C9C0B9CC0020B9D0C774C57C002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앞으로 같이 재미있는 일을 많이 해 봐.\n그렇게 해 주는 게 트레이너의 역할이잖아.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 4312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C55EC73CB85C0020AC19C7740020C7ACBBF8C788B2940020C77CC7440020B9CEC7740020D5740020BD10002E000AADF8B807AC8C0020D5740020C8FCB2940020AC8C0020D2B8B808C774B108C7580020C5EDD560C774C796C544002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나도 너희 덕분에\n재미있는 일을 많이 경험하고 있다구.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 4416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B3C40020B108D76C0020B355BD84C5D0000AC7ACBBF8C788B2940020C77CC7440020B9CEC7740020ACBDD5D8D558ACE00020C788B2E4AD6C002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 수고~!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 4488,
